  "question": {
    "html": "<p>Planets X and Y orbit the same star.</p>\n<p>The average distance between planet X and the star is five times greater than the average distance between planet Y and the star.</p>\n<p>What is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{\\textit{orbital period of planet X}}{\\textit{orbital period of planet Y}}\"></span>?</p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\sqrt[3]{5}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\sqrt{5}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\sqrt[3]{5^{2}}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\sqrt{5^{3}}\"></span></li></ol>"
  },
